o_verify\\\",\n      \\\"note\\\": \\\"Security team approval has not yet been obtained; must be secured before sandbox access is provisioned.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Audit ticket creation\\\",\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"to_verify\\\",\n      \\\"note\\\": \\\"Audit ticket must be created and linked before the exception is activated per audit_log_rules.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Redaction completeness of replay package\\\",\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"missing\\\",\n      \\\"note\\\": \\\"No evidence confirms which redaction rules will be applied to the 500 traces; redaction completeness must be validated before export.\\\"\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Vendor sandbox environment readiness\\\",\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"missing\\\",\n      \\\"note\\\": \\\"No evidence confirms the vendor sandbox environment is provisioned and ready to receive the replay package.\\\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nENDJSON\necho \\\"wrote\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
